@ 17:8  user --|> shop
  17:6-17:9 "-->"
  | **`-->`**
  |
  | `-->`: a relation from the first element to the second.
@ 18:7  user <|-- shop
  18:6-18:9 "<--"
  | **`<--`**
  |
  | `<--`: a relation read right to left: the second element is its source.
@ 19:8  user <-|-> shop
  19:6-19:10 "<-->"
  | **`<-->`**
  |
  | `<-->`: a relation that points both ways.
@ 20:8  user --|- shop
  20:6-20:9 "---"
  | **`---`**
  |
  | `---`: a relation with no arrowhead, drawn between the two elements as it is written. `----` and `--->` are not undirected arrows.
